let __v_336 = Value::from("In the bank's own app there is usually an 'Add to Apple Pay' or 'Add to Google Pay' button on the card, and it is the quickest way; otherwise open Wallet on the phone and add the card number by hand or with the camera. The bank then sends a code, and some cards need one contactless payment with the PIN before the phone version works.");
