let __v_338 = Value::from("Nine times in ten it is the phone, not the card: the screen has to be on and unlocked, NFC (contactless) has to be switched on, and the card has to be the one set as default in Wallet - check all three and try the back of the phone flat on the reader, not the edge. If it still refuses, take the phone out of its case, and try a second till or a shop you have used before, because one terminal can be the fault. When the phone taps nowhere at all, the card itself still works: use the plastic, then remove the card in the bank app and add it again, which reissues the token - and if the app says the card is blocked, ring the bank, because a block is on the card and no amount of tapping clears it.");
