let __v_446 = Value::from("Spend £100 to £200 on a used handset or a hand-me-down and a cover, then a SIM-only deal at £6 to £10 a month in your name rather than a contract: the price is not what makes it safe, and two years of contract on a phone a child will probably lose is the expensive mistake. Set it up before you hand it over - Family Link on an Android or Screen Time on an iPhone for limits and app approvals, in-app purchases off, and one agreed place it sleeps at night.");
