let __v_453 = Value::from("A refurbished handset from the maker's own store, or a used one from a shop like CeX, is £60 to £120 with a guarantee, and a hand-me-down from family is free: what matters is that it runs the apps the school uses and still gets security updates, not that it is new. Pair it with a SIM-only deal at £6 to £10 a month in your name, turn off in-app purchases, and say plainly that this is the phone for now rather than the phone they asked for.");
