let __v_489 = Value::from("Register free with the Telephone Preference Service (tps.org.uk) to cut marketing calls, and use the phone's own block list for the ones that keep coming: on an iPhone it is Settings > Phone > Silence Unknown Callers, on Android it is Caller ID and spam protection in the Phone app. Never press a number to \"speak to someone\" or reply to a silent call, because that proves the line is live; if the caller says they are your bank, hang up and ring the number on your card.");
