let __v_708 = Value::from("Stop using the {thing} now, and do not save anything else to it: a deleted file is still there under the space a new one would take, and every file you add can cover it. Plug it into a computer and run a recovery tool that only reads the {thing} - Recuva on Windows, or PhotoRec on any system, both free - and run the deep scan, because a quick one misses the older files. If it was pulled out without ejecting, the files may be there and the index damaged, so run the computer's own check (chkdsk on Windows, First Aid on a Mac) before you give up: that fixes the view of the file, not the file itself.");
