let __v_10413 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"modem\",\"modems\"]},\"A modem turns the signal on the line coming into your home - fibre, cable or the phone socket - into a network connection, and the router is what shares that connection round the house. Most home boxes do both jobs in one, which is why people use the two words for the same box; the modem is the half that talks to the street.\",{\"$tuple\":[\"my modem\",\"not working\",\"flashing\",\"red light\",\"restart\",\"reset\",\"replace\",\"how do i\"]}]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"cookie\",\"cookies\"]},\"A cookie is a small file a website asks your browser to store: the note that keeps you signed in, the contents of your basket, or an ID that follows you between pages. It is not a program and it cannot read your files - the worst of them is tracking - and clearing them signs you out of most sites.\",{\"$tuple\":[\"recipe\",\"bake\",\"baking\",\"biscuit\",\"dough\",\"oven\",\"flour\",\"butter\",\"chocolate\",\"sugar\",\"bake\",\"tin\",\"tray\",\"my cookies\",\"accept\",\"banner\",\"how do i\",\"should i\",\"consent\",\"gdpr\"]}]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"ransomware\"]},\"Ransomware is a kind of malware that scrambles your files and then sells you the key: a message appears, the documents and photos will not open, and it wants money, usually in cryptocurrency. The one thing that reliably saves you is a backup you were not connected to when it struck, and paying often gets nothing back, so unplug the machine and get help before you do anything else.\",{\"$tuple\":[\"my\",\"i have\",\"infected\",\"hit by\",\"attack\",\"attacked\",\"caught\",\"paid\",\"pay\",\"removal\",\"remove\",\"fix\",\"recover\",\"how do i\",\"should i\",\"protect\"]}]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"phishing\",\"phishing email\",\"phishing text\",\"phishing message\"]},\"Phishing is a fake message dressed up as your bank, a courier or HMRC to get you to log in or pay: the link goes to a page that looks right and the details go to the thief. The tell is the address it really came from and the urgency, so do not use the link - open the company's app or type the address yourself - and report it as phishing.\",{\"$tuple\":[\"i got\",\"i clicked\",\"i have\",\"my\",\"what should i do\",\"how do i\",\"is this\",\"was it\",\"am i\"]}]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"password manager\",\"password managers\"]},\"A password manager is an app that keeps your passwords encrypted behind one master password or your face, and fills them in for you: Bitwarden, 1Password, the one built into Chrome, Safari and iCloud. It can invent a long random password for every site, which is the point - you only ever remember the one that opens the manager.\",{\"$tuple\":[\"my\",\"which\",\"best\",\"how do i\",\"should i\",\"set up\",\"forgot\",\"lost\",\"family\",\"free\",\"recommend\"]}]},{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"cloud storage\",\"cloud backup\",\"the cloud\"]},\"Cloud storage is your files kept on someone else's servers and copied to your devices: iCloud, Google Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox. It is a copy rather than a backup if it syncs the deletion too - keep one copy that is not attached, or the ransomware or the accidental delete reaches it as well.\",{\"$tuple\":[\"weather\",\"sky\",\"rain\",\"forecast\",\"full\",\"storage full\",\"upgrade\",\"plan\",\"price\",\"cost\",\"my\",\"which\",\"best\",\"how do i\",\"should i\"]}]}]}")?;
